        <footnote id="F1">Pursuant to the Issuer's Amended and Restated Certificate of Incorporation, as amended, each share of Series Seed-2 Convertible Preferred Stock, Series A-1 Convertible Preferred Stock, Series A-2 Convertible Preferred Stock, Series B Convertible Preferred Stock, and Series C Convertible Preferred Stock (collectively, the &quot;Preferred Stock&quot;) was convertible, at the option of the holder, at any time. In connection with the completion of the Issuer's initial public offering of its Common Stock, each share of Preferred Stock automatically converted on a 1-for-9.8821 basis into shares of Common Stock, for no additional consideration. Share numbers give effect to such conversion. The securities have no expiration date.</footnote>
